{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>I have divined.</b> He was a diviner: I tested with my divination that through you blessing came to me. When you came here he had no sons, as it says ״וְהִנֵּה רָחֵל בִּתּוֹ בָּאָה עִם הַצֹּאן״ (Genesis 29:6) — is it possible he has sons and sends his daughter among the shepherds? Now he had sons, as it says ״וַיִּשְׁמַע אֶת דִּבְרֵי בְנֵי לָבָן״ (ibid. 31)."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:01:18.440404443Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}